          "content": "### Local durable-state QA\n\nThis isolated fixture tests native Data Table create, empty lookup, insert/update through upsert, typed columns, and frozen JSON recovery. It creates or reuses one QA table and one synthetic state row. No Google services, paid render, or sharing node is present.\n\nRun manually. Success means one row remains after both state saves, with the accepted synthetic ID retained and an ISO date returned. The synthetic ID must never be used as a real render job."
        }
